      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218283/assets/17c126ec4e6f901d038d28ca52ce3dedfb79abcd630694cfb465a57720fa6a42.png)\n\nThe graph of $y=f(x)-2$ is shown above. Which of the following is the graph of $y=f(x)?$",
